<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Cartwright & Checa (2007) & Cartwright et al. (2009) nacre screw-dislocation spirals, Frank-Read target terraces, and defect pair annihilation (Pteria hirundo & Pinctada margaritifera (Bivalvia sheet nacre) / Haliotis rufescens & Gibbula umbilicalis (Gastropoda tower nacre))",
        "Cartwright & Checa (2007) & Cartwright et al. (2009) nacre screw-dislocation spirals, Frank-Read target terraces, and defect pair annihilation faithfully reproduces Pteria hirundo & Pinctada margaritifera (Bivalvia sheet nacre) / Haliotis rufescens & Gibbula umbilicalis (Gastropoda tower nacre) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-1>,
