        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2007-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Pteria hirundo & Pinctada margaritifera (Bivalvia sheet nacre) / Haliotis rufescens & Gibbula umbilicalis (Gastropoda tower nacre) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 48.9/100, audit 2026-10-19-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/HEAD/2007-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces.py> ;
    schema:about "Pteria hirundo & Pinctada margaritifera (Bivalvia sheet nacre) / Haliotis rufescens & Gibbula umbilicalis (Gastropoda tower nacre)" ;
